  "description": "O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this spacious duplex apartment in the Caireal Mor development of Galway City. \r\n\r\nCaireal Mor is large multi-unit development with well-maintained communal areas & and ample resident parking. \r\n\r\nFalling into the local parish of Castlegar, this location is ideal for any purchaser & offers ease of access to both the East and West sides of Galway as well as to the city centre itself. \r\n\r\nThe main Galway Headford Road provides access to nearby shopping centres and retail parks such as Terryland, Dunnes & Galway Shopping Centre.\r\n\r\nNo.171 Caireal Mor is presented in turnkey condition, offering cira 97 sq.m with ample accommodation over two storeys.\r\n\r\nBenefitting from its own door entrance, the accommodation is comprised of an entrance hall with access to a fully fitted kitchen and open plan living & dining room, with balcony of living area.\r\n\r\nThe upper floor contains a main bathroom and three fine sized bedrooms all with wardobes & wooden flooring.  One of the bedrooms has a balcony and the master bedroom containing an en suite bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe area is well serviced with several excellent National & Secondary Schools with multiple third level & technical institutions within easy reach. \r\n\r\nLocated with easy reach of several large employment hubs, business parks & multi-nationals such as Parkmore, Creganna, Medtronic & Boston Scientific, Bon Secour, Merlin Park, and Galway Clinic hospitals.\r\n\r\nQuality transport links allow easy access to Galway City Centre, neighbouring suburbs, as well as the M6 & M18 motorways.\r\n\r\nThere are ample sports and recreational facilities also available in the area. \r\n\r\nNo 171 Caireal Mor is an ideal property for a variety of purchasers, whether first time buyer or investor looking for a great property in a popular well-established area of Galway City.  \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and guaranteed not to disappoint.\r\n\r\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database \r\n\r\nFor Further details please contact our office on 091-564212 \r\nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\r\n\r\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \r\n\r\nNOTE:  These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer.  They are for information only and give a general idea of the property.  They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.  Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy.  Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.  No person in the employment of O’Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property.",
